# Ship the ai-bridge runtime dependency inside the VSIX.
# The spawned daemon does `import('@opencode-ai/sdk/v2')` at runtime, so
# `ai-bridge/node_modules` MUST be packaged. The blanket `**/node_modules/**`
# above would strip it and crash the daemon after install; re-include it here.
!ai-bridge/node_modules/**
